4
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:29.800
<v Sarah Chen>Got it. Marcus, can you chase the compliance team today and get a confirmed date? Let's say by end of this week — so by Friday.</v>

5
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.500
