14
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:43.200
<v Sarah Chen>Agreed. Marcus and Tom, co-own the migration runbook. It needs to be done before the launch rehearsal, so let's say July 28th.</v>

15
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:51.800
