18
00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:13.700
<v Leila Hassan>One more thing — the onboarding email sequence still uses the old brand. Someone needs to update the copy and swap the logo assets before launch.</v>

19
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:22.400
<v Sarah Chen>Good catch. Leila, add that to your plate — update onboarding email templates with new branding. Deadline end of July, so July 31st.</v>

20
00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:28.100
