21
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:36.800
<v Sarah Chen>Absolutely, that's critical. Tom, set up the feature flag infrastructure. We need that done by July 24th so beta can start on the 25th.</v>

22
00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:44.500
<v Marcus Webb>I can also handle writing the internal release notes for the engineering team. I'll do that in parallel — targeting July 25th.</v>

23
00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:52.200
<v Sarah Chen>Great. Let me just recap what we've agreed: Marcus chases the security audit today, Marcus and Tom write the migration runbook by the 28th, Marcus writes release notes by the 25th.</v>

24
