<v Sarah Chen>Priya finishes the dashboard by August 8th and owns the accessibility audit report by August 5th. Leila exports design tokens by tomorrow noon and updates onboarding emails by July 31st.</v>

25
00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:08.700
<v Sarah Chen>Tom fixes the rate-limit performance regression by July 21st and sets up feature flags by July 24th. Does everyone have their items?</v>

26
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.200
<v Tom Adeyemi>Yep, all clear.</v>

27
00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.000
<v Priya Nair>Got it.</v>

28
00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:14.800
<v Marcus Webb>Confirmed.</v>

29
00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.500
<v Leila Hassan>All good.</v>

30
00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:21.000
<v Sarah Chen>Perfect. Let's sync again mid-week. Thanks everyone.</v>
